WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.067 --> 00:00:02.940
- "How does the heart keep
beating and beating for years

00:00:02.940 --> 00:00:03.900
and never stop?"

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:06.900
Don't stop, won't stop,
heartbeats for life.

00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:07.980
It just does.

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:11.910
You have an SA node, an AV
node, the Purkinje fibers,

00:00:11.910 --> 00:00:15.180
they go throughout your heart
and they help your conduction.

00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:16.950
If the electrical system is there,

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:18.960
the musculoskeletal system will listen.

00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:20.760
As long as everything else is in place

00:00:20.760 --> 00:00:23.197
you know, oxygen, electrolytes,
all the good stuff.

00:00:23.197 --> 00:00:26.220
"Okay, so pathologists study
a tumor once it's removed,

00:00:26.220 --> 00:00:27.053
but then what?

00:00:27.053 --> 00:00:28.260
Does it get incinerated?

00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:30.150
Sent to the dump? Shot into space?"

00:00:30.150 --> 00:00:31.350
Well, it doesn't get shot into space,

00:00:31.350 --> 00:00:32.595
'cause that'd be quite expensive.

00:00:32.595 --> 00:00:35.250
It gets thrown out in
the biohazard disposal.

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:36.210
What happens with it then?

00:00:36.210 --> 00:00:37.043
I have no idea.

00:00:37.043 --> 00:00:38.700
But you've seen those biohazard red bins,

00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:39.870
that's where the tumor goes.

00:00:39.870 --> 00:00:42.120
And there's no need to incinerate it,

00:00:42.120 --> 00:00:43.260
you don't need to burn it.

00:00:43.260 --> 00:00:44.610
Actually, I guess if there's like

00:00:44.610 --> 00:00:45.870
infectious things in there,

00:00:45.870 --> 00:00:47.190
maybe you do need to burn it,

00:00:47.190 --> 00:00:48.810
and it ends up being incinerated.

00:00:48.810 --> 00:00:51.217
Like let's Google what happens.

00:00:51.217 --> 00:00:54.720
"What happens to biohazard waste?"

00:00:54.720 --> 00:00:59.040
Oh, 90% of biohazard waste is incinerated.

00:00:59.040 --> 00:01:00.037
The more you know.

00:01:00.037 --> 00:01:02.700
